; improvements (docs/ART.md 5.7-5.8, 6.2): small objects in the tile's lower half, painted by
; tools/atlas/compose_map.py (huts, keeps, caves, obelisks... as lit shapes, one void outline), up to
; 8 colours; fields and plantations are flat ground marks without outline.
; Placed with the anchor at tile (16, 29) unless `: place` says otherwise. `: flat` ones are drawn
; in the ground pass, under trees and buildings.
; The unique landmarks (6.2) are the terrain set's (improvement/landmark_*); _landmark below is only the
; fallback for unique types added later.

